WEBVTT

NOTE EVERY SENSE JING-ZHANG multimodal short film - English captions - same cue timing as journey.vtt, translated from the same transcript in journey.md

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.231
EVERY SENSE JING-ZHANG: an AI city that every kind of body can use independently.

2
00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:08.335
Urban intelligence is not measured by device count.

3
00:00:08.385 --> 00:00:14.190
It is tested by whether anyone can understand, choose, complete and exit the same public service.

4
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:20.966
The framework is one Universal Access Baseline, three Multisensory Labs and ten Independent Completion Points.

5
00:00:21.316 --> 00:00:28.210
Zhongzhiyuan takes validation, the AI Origin Community takes co-design, Dazhongsi takes adoption and exit.

6
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:34.586
The ten Independent Completion Points are public interfaces that are recognisable, inhabitable, testable and exitable.

7
00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:40.268
Flip the AI switch: the same spine, the same ten nodes.

8
00:00:42.068 --> 00:00:46.329
The declared node-coverage readout stays the same; only the channel for completing the task changes.

9
00:00:47.156 --> 00:00:52.057
A common gauge lets different trains share one network; universal design lets different bodies share one city.

10
00:00:52.858 --> 00:00:55.913
One city. Many ways to sense it.

11
00:00:55.963 --> 00:01:01.276
This film is a conceptual recommendation; it is not a statutory plan, an engineering alignment or an approval conclusion.
